# sbom.cdx.json is generated by tools/write_sbom.py, which writes LF on every
# platform so the bytes are reproducible and the committed blob is stable.
# Without -text, a checkout with core.autocrlf=true converts it to CRLF, and
# the next check_versions.py --write writes LF again: git then reports the file
# modified while git diff is empty and it stages to nothing. Marking it -text
# keeps the working copy as LF, matching both the blob and the generator.
sbom.cdx.json -text
